[[File:Ausar Amen Thompson Twins 1232026.jpg|thumb|right|150px|[[Amen Thompson|Amen]] and [[Ausar Thompson]] were selected 4th and 5th overall by the [[Houston Rockets]] and [[Detroit Pistons]] respectively.]]
