The 9th G League Elite Camp took place on May 13–14, from which certain participants will be selected to join the main draft combine.<ref name="2023draftkeydate">{{cite web|last=Taylor|first=Cody|title=NBA draft 2023: Key dates for draft, combine, lottery and deadlines|url=https://therookiewire.usatoday.com/lists/nba-draft-2023-key-dates-combine-lottery-deadlines/|website=Rookie Wire|publisher=USA Today Sports|date=March 19, 2023|access-date=April 19, 2023}}</ref>

